  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <JapaneseText>クレスタ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cresta</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>クレスタ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cresta</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ん････
うぅ、こ、ここは････？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nn...ugh,
w, where are we...?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>気がついたか、&lt;Kyle&gt;？
安心しろ、もうクレスタに着いた
ガキどもは、先に帰しておいたよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You awake, &lt;Kyle&gt;? We've already
arrived in Cresta, so no need to worry.
I went ahead and sent the kids on home.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あぁ、それと
さっきのことは口止めしておいた
ルーティさんに知れたら、大変だからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Also, I told them to keep what happened
earlier under wraps too. We'd be in some
serious shit if Rutee ever found out.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>････ごめんね、&lt;Loni&gt;
ひさしぶりに会ったっていうのに
迷惑ばっかりかけちゃって････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Man, I'm sorry, &lt;Loni&gt;. I ended up
causing nothing but trouble for you even
though we haven't seen each other in ages...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>迷惑ぅ？　ははっ！
水くさいぜ、&lt;Kyle&gt;
俺とおまえの仲じゃねえか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Trouble? Ha ha!
Don't be such a stranger, &lt;Kyle&gt;.
You 'n' me are pals, aren't we?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>それに、俺がアタモニ神団に入ってから
孤児院のことは、まかせっきりだったしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And besides, I pretty much dumped the orphanage on
you and all after I joined the Church of Atamoni.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>罪滅ぼしじゃねえが
これぐらいは、当然のことさ
気にすんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It ain't much in terms of atonement,
but something like this is nothing.
Don't sweat it.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Loni&gt;････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Loni&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうだ、孤児院へ帰る前に
街の中をぶらついてみないか？
ひさしぶりに、みんなに会いたいしな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why don't we try to take a stroll through
town before returning to the orphanage? It's
been a minute, so I want to see everyone.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>じゃ、そうしようか
････って&lt;Loni&gt;
そろそろ降ろしてくんない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's do that then.
...or rather, &lt;Loni&gt;,
isn't it about time that you put me down?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ん～？　別に、このままでもいいぜ？
なんかよ、おまえの重さがなつかしくってな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm? It doesn't really matter if we stay like this, does
it? Your weight brings back memories for some reason.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <JapaneseText>バ、バカッ！
子供あつかいすんなよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>D, don't be stupid! 
Quit treating me like a child!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <JapaneseText>はははっ！
わかった、わかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha ha ha!
I gotcha, I gotcha.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <JapaneseText>んじゃ行くか、&lt;Kyle&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you comin', &lt;Kyle&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いってらっしゃいませ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good day.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt;ガルドになりますが
お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'll be &lt;0B:00000001&gt;{14}{34}{08}{C0}&lt;0B:00000000&gt; gald a night.
Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お泊まりになりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you like to stay?</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;03:00000000&gt;　はい　
　いいえ　</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;03:00000000&gt; Yes 
 No </EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ごゆっくりお休みください</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have a good night.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <JapaneseText>おはようございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good morning.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <JapaneseText>お金が足りません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not enough money.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <JapaneseText>またのおこしをお待ちしております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>See you again soon.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{25}{BA}{C0}を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired {16}{25}{BA}{C0}.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;を手に入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Acquired &lt;item:FFFFFFFF&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <JapaneseText>{16}{25}{C2}{C0}がありましたが
いっぱいで持てませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Found {16}{25}{C2}{C0}, but
inventory full already.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <JapaneseText>何もありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's nothing here.</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
